        o1b: "Only use images",
        o1c: "Compare sources and check facts", // Correct
        q2: "Area 2 (Communicate): What is an important rule of 'Netiquette'?",
        o2a: "Write in all caps (shouting)",
        o2b: "Express yourself politely in digital environments", // Correct
        o2c: "Forward all chain letters",
        q3: "Area 3 (Produce): What must students consider when using other people's images?",
        o3a: "Images can be used without citation",
        o3b: "Respect copyrights and use Creative Commons", // Correct
        o3c: "All photos have no copyright",
        q4: "Area 4 (Protect): What is the best way to protect your accounts?",
        o4a: "Same password everywhere",
        o4b: "Share password with friends",
        o4c: "Use a long, secure password", // Correct
